      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #F8FAFC; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">7. Third-Party Links & Advertising</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Our Service may contain links to third-party websites and may display advertisements from Google AdSense. We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party sites you visit.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #F8FAFC; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">8. Governing Law</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        These Terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with applicable laws, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Our failure to enforce any right or provision of these Terms will not be considered a waiver of those rights.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #F8FAFC; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">9. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        We reserve the right to modify or replace these Terms at any time at our sole discretion. If a revision is material, we will try to provide at least 14 days notice prior to any new terms taking effect. What constitutes a material change will be determined at our sole discretion.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #F8FAFC; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us:</p>
